<title>UK: ACPC will definitely implement export cut.</title>
<headline>ACPC will definitely implement export cut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivorian commodities minister Guy-Alain Gauze said on Wednesday that the 1.3 million 60 kilos bags cut in coffee exports for the first six months of 1997 would definitely be implemented.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no doubt about it, it is a question of credibility of the Association said Gauze on the fringes of the International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) talks here.</p>
</text>
